{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）早上8時34分，一輛私家車在吐露港公路上水方向近康樂園發生意外，撞壆後翻側路中，司機報警稱未能落車。人員到場協助，正檢查其傷勢。由網上圖片可見，私家車翻側在左二線，一條車胎甩脫丟在路中。</p><p>運輸署宣布，因交通意外，吐露港公路（往上水方向）近碗窰的部份行車線現已封閉。駕駛人士只可使用餘下行車線行車。至上午9時45分解封，車龍有待消散。</p><figure><img alt=\"私家車翻側路中。（Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200374101668007936370589.jpeg/yuzEutVmJLKn3q8zPyXyFvHUXPrcHvDa7kQzO-5EMzs\"/><figcaption>私家車翻側路中。（Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車翻側路中，一條車胎飛脫。（Facebook圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200372500815417344537612.jpeg/fQ3k6vDPNmmx-3KQ4dp8HC0WrKW4nw8CioqW84qKlvM\"/><figcaption>私家車翻側路中，一條車胎飛脫。（Facebook圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:03:55.916047+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:01:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T05:17:31.317739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T01:57:29.422042+00:00","content_hash":"68259a25da3f9bcffcb41c5d6ec700cf7ace147dcd7ee7084e830c10ef38ad44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}